    <description>This flow creates an order allocation request for a blanket sales order, and sends user to a subflow to make edits and allocations.

3/3/26 - [RFS23-12886] Add new &quot;Program&quot; field to BSO data table.
2/25/26 - [RFS23-11881] Updated language.
9/4/25 - [RFS23-10955] Replace Commit Transaction with new Apex action to commit DML. Update API version. Add fault paths.

3/5/25 - [RFS23-8535] Change variable used to map the related Account on the Order Allocation records. Set status of new OA to &quot;new&quot;.

1/2/25 - RFS23-7399] Fix text formatting issue.

12/18/24 - [RF23-7889] Fix {!frm_Order_Allocation_Number} to remove the extra space in the number. This caused the &quot;Create Order Allocation Products&quot; flow to not evaluate properly.

11/25/24 - [RFS23-7412] Removed site number/name screen entirely, updated components to support changes. [RFS23-7509] Updated column names.

11/15/24 - Enable pagination. Update styles. Remove option to create multiple sites, replaced with name First Site instead, removed related components.

2-1: Mapped allocation count to autofill and distribute quantities when OA Products are created.
2/7 - Added Related Opportunity to the Order Allocations; allocation req screen updates, include Submitted Requests.
2/14 - Ability to add a new request if all prior requests have been submitted.
5/27 - do not display Cancelled OA Requests
6/4/24 - [RFS23-5848] Require users to enter a number, 1-15, for the number of sites. Updated language to support.
[RFS23-4233] A customer cannot create a secondary allocation request when a previous allocation request is open.</description>
